XAScraft
========

XAScraft is a web application built on xraylarch (Larch), the X-ray absorption and
fluorescence analysis library by Matthew Newville and the xraylarch contributors:
https://github.com/xraypy/xraylarch. The Larch library itself is not included in this
repository; it is installed from the upstream commit pinned in larch-patches/PIN.

The following parts of this repository come from xraylarch and are distributed under
its MIT license (see LICENSE):

- examples/: the example data and scripts, taken unchanged from xraylarch at commit
  8d6cd41c2b2a19260dbc80519c3c95211331d4fc, except the files the XAScraft team added
  after that commit:
    examples/athena/curated_demo/  (the whole folder; data sources are recorded in its
                                    manifest.json and README.md)
    examples/xafsdata/Cu2O_standard.0001

- larch-patches/series/: changes to xraylarch source files, made by the XAScraft team on
  top of the pinned upstream commit. Each patch modifies files that come from xraylarch.

- backend/tests/test_larch_remove_dups.py and backend/tests/test_larch_agreement.py:
  three copies of xraylarch functions, which those tests compare against: remove_dups
  (larch.math.utils) and FeffPathGroup.__path_params (larch.xafs.feffdat) as at commit
  8d6cd41c2b2a19260dbc80519c3c95211331d4fc, and FeffPathGroup.__path_params as at
  commit c18a4ed63f7945ba52dbe6dd93e28e8f4b075b93.

Eight test fixtures in backend/tests/fixtures/ are byte-identical to files that
xraylarch also distributes at commit 8d6cd41c2b2a19260dbc80519c3c95211331d4fc
(fixture <- xraylarch file):
    demeter-cmc.dat               <- examples/xafsdata/beamlines/APS9BM_2006.dat
    demeter-diff.prj              <- examples/xafsdata/AthenaProjectFiles/diff_ex.prj
    demeter-hxma.dat              <- examples/xafsdata/beamlines/CLSHXMA.dat
    demeter-mee-LaCoO3.prj        <- examples/xafsdata/AthenaProjectFiles/LaCoO3.prj
    demeter-merge-fe.060          <- examples/xafsdata/fe.060
    demeter-pfbl12c.dat           <- examples/xafsdata/beamlines/PFBL12C_2005.dat
    demeter-snbl.dat              <- examples/xafsdata/beamlines/ESRF_SNBL_2013.dat
    xdi-official-cu_metal_rt.xdi  <- dylibs/XDI/cu_metal_rt.xdi
Their recorded origin (in the fixture manifests, backend/tests/fixtures/athena-*.json,
and for demeter-diff.prj in docs/athena-difference-reference.md) is Demeter
(https://github.com/bruceravel/demeter) at commit
06afc8da08a5a7d5a26ee14992170fcf5dc67406, except xdi-official-cu_metal_rt.xdi, from the
XAS Data Interchange project (https://github.com/XraySpectroscopy/XAS-Data-Interchange)
at commit ed21ad5aa3a066f569e13e607679b2542fc93fa7.
